QUESTION: which vehicle have maximum harsh braking events
STANDALONE REWRITE: Which vehicle in our fleet of 22 vehicles from manufacturers such as Ashok Leyland, BharatBenz, and Eicher, has the maximum number of harsh braking events?
GENERATED T-SQL: SELECT TOP 1 v.vehicle_name, COUNT(bwe.id) AS TotalBrakeEvents 
FROM vehicles v 
INNER JOIN brake_wear_events bwe ON v.id = bwe.vehicle_id 
INNER JOIN journeys j ON v.id = j.vehicle_id 
WHERE bwe.event_type = 'harsh_brake' 
GROUP BY v.vehicle_name 
ORDER BY TotalBrakeEvents DESC
